    "description": "Arugu meedha kurchoni, aadhar card white color kakunda, pink peti unte baundu anukune rakhalu ee free ga salahalu ichetolu. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nOdhilesthe World Peace motham piece piece ga ipokunda kapadina salaha namde antaru. Inka na level lo ded cheap ga chepali ante, Newton yevadra ante mana biggboss Nuthan Naidu ae ga antaru. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nBut hey (yes English ae)! On a very positive note, annam lo raallu common, jeevitham lo ilanti yedavalu common. Konni keerthanalu cheptha, adhi vinnaka, ‘TING’u mani neeku yelige chance le yekuva untai,⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\n- Upma lo karepaku vadtham kani pakkaki pedatham.⁣⁣\n- Biryani lo elaichi yestham kani thisipadestham.⁣⁣\n- Mari perugu lo attipandu? Urukora sattipandu antam.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nTelusukovalsina neethi yenti ante, its a mere process to success. Imperfect ga chepali ante ‘Karepaku-elaichi-attipandu’ - ee context lo manushulu iche salahalu lantivi, nee gelupu ane monument lo oka chinna moment lantivi. Anthe.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nProcess ante yenti bhayya antav? Cute boy Pranav. ⁣⁣\n⁣\n- Gudikelthe mantralu intav, process. ⁣⁣\n- Snanam chesthe soap rasukuntav, process.⁣⁣\n- Nee gelupu elevate avvali ante, ilanti yedavalu life lo undali. PROCESS.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\n‘Kashtam osthe kadhalipoku, gelupu ni odhilipoku’. Edhisheyyy!⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nUnfaithfully your's,⁣⁣\n#fakemuchatlu⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nP.S 1: Yesukuna pant ki, samandham leni shirt tho ochi ‘adhi attipandu kadhu aritipandu’ ani anamaka. Nenu anthe, na slang anthe. Yeti selayev. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nP.S 2: Yesukuna jacket ki, cheera ki samandham lekunda ‘ante yenti ipudu advice ivatam thappa?’ ani adagamaka. IAS aspirant ki IAS officer chepakappoina, atleast IAS coaching centre owner chepthe oka andham. Adhe nuvu chepthe, Sunny Leone santhoor soap gurinchi chepinatte untundhi. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nP.S 3: On humanitarian grounds, let's omit parents from the above topic. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nP.S 4: Unused dialogue ‘Aavu road meedhane peda yendhuku yesthundho telidhu. Kontha mandhi salahalu yendhuku istharo, telusukovalsina avasaram ledhu.’ Subham. Jai Hind",
